"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-1255](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-1255)\r\n### Description\n\nIt's possible to get in a state where YSQL `CREATE INDEX` hangs.\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n./bin/yb-ctl --tserver_flags 'backfill_index_client_rpc_timeout_ms=1000,TEST_slowdown_backfill_by_ms=30000'\r\n```\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nCREATE TABLE t (i int);\r\nCREATE INDEX ON t (i);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `CREATE INDEX` will time out in a few seconds due to the 1s backfill client timeout.  The BackfillChunk RPC from master to tserver will take at least 30s.  During that time, issue the following\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nDROP INDEX t_i_idx;\r\n```\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n./bin/yb-ctl stop\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis interrupts the in-progress BackfillChunk, so it never gets a chance to respond to master.  When starting up the cluster again (without the flags), the issue will show up.\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n./bin/yb-ctl start\r\n```\r\n\r\n```sql\r\n\\d t\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n                 Table \"public.t\"\r\n Column |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default\r\n--------+---------+-----------+----------+---------\r\n i      | integer |           |          |\r\n```\r\n\r\nNotice there's no index as expected since we dropped it.\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nCREATE INDEX ON t (i);\r\n```\r\n\r\n...hangs.  The master logs show why:\r\n\r\n```\r\nI1123 16:48:39.853030  9386 backfill_index.cc:347] StartBackfillingData starting backfill on t [id=000033c0000030008000000000004000] for [table_id: \"000033c0000030008000000000004100\" version: 0 is_local: false hash_column_count: 0 range_column_count: 0 is_unique: false indexed_table_id: \"000033c0000030008000000000004000\" use_mangled_column_name: false index_permissions: INDEX_PERM_WRITE_AND_DELETE backfill_error_message: \"\"]\r\nW1123 16:48:39.853201  9386 backfill_index.cc:599] No table info can be found with index table id 000033c0000030008000000000004003\r\nI1123 16:48:39.853300  9386 async_rpc_tasks.cc:294] Backfilling indexes {  } for tablet 6c29dbb6923e48ee953c0f785af77a31 from key '' (task=0x37a05b0, state=kFailed): No reschedule for this task\r\nI1123 16:48:39.853365  9386 backfill_index.cc:1117] Failed to backfill the tablet 0x0000000006c18f00 -> 6c29dbb6923e48ee953c0f785af77a31 (table t [id=000033c0000030008000000000004000]): Not found: Could not find IndexInfoPB for some indexes\r\nFailed_indexes are [000033c0000030008000000000004003]\r\nE1123 16:48:39.853389  9386 backfill_index.cc:819] Backfill Index Table(s) { t_i_idx } failed to backfill the index: [000033c0000030008000000000004003] due to Not found: Could not find IndexInfoPB for some indexes\r\nI1123 16:48:39.865437  9386 backfill_index.cc:944] Done backfill on t [id=000033c0000030008000000000004000] setting permissions to [{000033c0000030008000000000004003, 8}]\r\nI1123 16:48:39.865487  9386 backfill_index.cc:1269] Started BackfillChunk : Backfilling indexes {  } for tablet 6c29dbb6923e48ee953c0f785af77a31 from key ''\r\nI1123 16:48:39.868415  9558 backfill_index.cc:246] t [id=000033c0000030008000000000004000] - Alter table completed version=3, state: RUNNING\r\nI1123 16:48:39.868541  9559 backfill_index.cc:246] t [id=000033c0000030008000000000004000] - Alter table completed version=3, state: RUNNING\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis doesn't seem to be a serious issue since starting another `ysqlsh` to drop the index resolves the problem for the future.\r\n\r\nYCQL seems to do fine\r\n\r\n```\r\nI1123 17:00:55.073688 14268 backfill_index.cc:1117] Failed to backfill the tablet 0x0000000005422500 -> a5b81563bae14ec185beb2f0eb30be80 (table t [id=723d587068424d40aaa8043a2bdfbaf2]): Invalid argument (yb/tserver/tablet_service.cc:781): Tablet has a different schema 10 vs 10. Requested index is not ready to backfill. IndexMap: 0x00000000037d10a8 -> [{d48f4edd1abb4a79ae9377c158e594a3, table_id: \"d48f4edd1abb4a79ae9377c158e594a3\" version: 0 is_local: false columns { column_id: 0 indexed_column_id: 1 column_name: \"C$_j\" colexpr { column_id: 1 } } columns { column_id: 1 indexed_column_id: 0 column_name: \"C$_i\" colexpr { column_id: 0 } } hash_column_count: 1 range_column_count: 1 is_unique: false indexed_table_id: \"723d587068424d40aaa8043a2bdfbaf2\" indexed_hash_column_ids: 0 use_mangled_column_name: true index_permissions: INDEX_PERM_DO_BACKFILL backfill_error_message: \"\"}]                                                                                                                                 \r\nFailed_indexes are [575c61521a174cc390ac9558400f904b]\r\nE1123 17:00:55.073730 14268 backfill_index.cc:819] Backfill Index Table(s) {  } failed to backfill the index: [575c61521a174cc390ac9558400f904b] due to Invalid argument (yb/tserver/tablet_service.cc:781): Tablet has a different schema 10 vs 10. Requested index is not ready to backfill. IndexMap: 0x00000000037d10a8 -> [{d48f4edd1abb4a79ae9377c158e594a3, table_id: \"d48f4edd1abb4a79ae9377c158e594a3\" version: 0 is_local: false columns { column_id: 0 indexed_column_id: 1 column_name: \"C$_j\" colexpr { column_id: 1 } } columns { column_id: 1 indexed_column_id: 0 column_name: \"C$_i\" colexpr { column_id: 0 } } hash_column_count: 1 range_column_count: 1 is_unique: false indexed_table_id: \"723d587068424d40aaa8043a2bdfbaf2\" indexed_hash_column_ids: 0 use_mangled_column_name: true index_permissions: INDEX_PERM_DO_BACKFILL backfill_error_message: \"\"}]\r\n...\r\nI1123 17:00:55.126121 14264 backfill_index.cc:944] Done backfill on t [id=723d587068424d40aaa8043a2bdfbaf2] setting permissions to [{d48f4edd1abb4a79ae9377c158e594a3, 6}]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is possibly related to issue #4936.  This was discovered when doing issue #10650 repro without the issue #10646 fix.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/10687/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/10687/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":15226382310,"node_id":"ATPVTE_lADOBlCVUc4_EHrNzwAAAAOLkCfm","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/15226382310","actor":{"login":"omkar-yb","id":89482921,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NDgyOTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8